<title>USA: Foothill declares dividend.</title>
<headline>Foothill declares dividend.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDORA, Calif. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foothill Independent Bancorp on Monday said it declared a 10 percent stock dividend payable June 20 to shareholders of record June 6.</p>
<p>It said the dividend reflects its strong 1996 results.</p>
</text>
